1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:07,700
I was born in 1998, in Leka Dulecha,
East Wollega.

2
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:14,700
My father, Bulti Firissa, is a teacher
of geography and history.

3
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:21,700
From him, I learned where we come from,
and how the world connects.

4
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:35,700
I went to Addis Ababa to study software
engineering.

5
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:42,700
My father mapped the land. I learned to
map systems.

6
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:49,700
Today I build banking systems at
Cooperative Bank of Oromia.

7
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:56,700
So that families like mine can send
money home in seconds.

8
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:13,700
My father taught the history of our
land. I hope to help write its future.
